    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n43930" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐήτριος</span></b>  (A), 
			Dor.
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐάτριος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἤτριον</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>with good</i> or <i>fine thread,
				well-woven</i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				47
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὕφασμα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Plt.</u>
					310e
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὕφη</span> (
				v.l.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑφαί</span>
			) <i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				<u>Comp.</u>
				23
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱμάτιον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Lex.</u>
					9
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἱ εὐ. σινδόνες</span>, of
			cotton, <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				15.1.20
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Act.
			, <i>well-weaving</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰν πέπλων εὐάτριον ἐργάτιν . .
					κερκίδα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					6.289
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Leon.
			</span></i>).</div>
